          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146464,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which term describes how sprites and UI elements are laid out by default before you move them with CSS?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Normal Flow</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Flow</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Basic Flow</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Normal Flow.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146465,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To make all HUD buttons appear on separate lines, set <code>display</code> to <code>block</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Start\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Options\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Quit\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"24\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"button\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": block;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"margin\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"5px\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>block</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146466,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To make the size of <code>span</code> HUD labels adjustable, code the <code>inline-block</code> value.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"span\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"HP\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"span\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"span\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Score\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"span\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"span\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Keys\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"span\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"29\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"span\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": inline-block;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"75px\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"background-color\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": moccasin;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"padding\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"5px\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>inline-block</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146467,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What happens when the combined width of <code>inline</code> HUD labels is wider than the game screen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The <code>inline</code> elements that don't fit get pushed down to different lines</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The webpage becomes horizontally scrollable</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The <code>inline</code> elements that don't fit  don't show on the webpage</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The <code>inline</code> elements that don't fit get pushed down to different lines.</p></body></html>"
          },
