            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which property is given to an element so HUD text doesn't wrap around a sprite image?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>clear</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>float</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>width</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>clear</code>.</p></body></html>"
